msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All those gaps in your memory...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫were from your lives as the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tous ces trous dans ta mémoire...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...viennent des vies que tu as passées en étant "
"la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F39D252D_0FF5_490E_AC6B_A49AF3966F0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1637b404febccacf1d206346e9fe3f0a654b843348e1c371afb7ac036e97e627
