msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there was the deranged man-beast.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By exposing your female body to him,⟪k:3⟫"
"you were able to temporarily contain his madness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et puis il y a eu l’homme-bête fou à lier.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫En lui montrant ton corps de femme nu,"
"⟪k:3⟫tu as pu contenir temporairement sa folie."

